    "title": "Brewfest brings beer, music, food & fun to City Park - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carl Cote ,\n9 hours ago (Lander, WY) – Lander Brewfest was held last weekend in City Park, bringing beer drinkers and breweries together for a fun-filled weekend in the shade. 21 breweries and five distilleries set up tents and loaded their kegs to show off their goods to roughly 1,700 festival goers across two days, and to compete in the yearly beer contests judged by category. Read full article",
